  "date": "Unknown",
  "content": "This is a recount of what my mother told me of her near death experience that occurred over 20 years ago. I do not know the details surrounding her situation. I do not know all of the details of her NDE. From what she told me, she experienced the bright light and beauty and happiness like never before. She was taken on travels to other planets and other places. She explained the feeling of wanting to stay there. She had an escort, but did not think it was someone she knew in her earthly life. She was told that she would have to come back to her life on earth as she still had things to do. This made her sad because she so wanted to stay where she was. She kept this all hidden for many years but did tell me this much of what she experienced. My mother passed on just six months ago and my only comfort is that she was reunited with the place she didn't want to leave. Since her death, my sister was visited in a dream by a white cat (my mother loved cats) and the cat told my sister that dying was not painful.",
